        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-474 (ensure controlled execution — CIT Risk, Insurance &amp; Cash Analytics (PA-81.3).) | - operational: automated alerts and pickup triggers
Owner: LP Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
